        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-27T14:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, transferPixels inserts a CopyTextureToBufferTask and a SyncToCpuTask directly, so we have to add the RenderPassTasks first. If the transfer tasks fail then the worst that will happen is that we\u0027ll render to the offscreen surfaces, which is inefficient but shouldn\u0027t affect any other rendering.",
